{
  "videoId": "2RB3edZyeYw",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "I need to do something substantial in order",
      "start": 52.92,
      "end": 56.32
    },
    {
      "text": "To get the attention of the clubs.",
      "start": 52.92,
      "end": 56.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Because they're exclusive and fun and they lead to a better life.",
      "start": 56.68,
      "end": 61.779999999999994
    },
    {
      "text": "People want to go on the internet and check out",
      "start": 62.44,
      "end": 66
    },
    {
      "text": "Their friends",
      "start": 62.44,
      "end": 66
    },
    {
      "text": "So not build a website that offers that?",
      "start": 62.44,
      "end": 66
    },
    {
      "text": "Friends, pictures, profiles",
      "start": 66,
      "end": 72.08
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm talking about taking the entire social experience of college",
      "start": 66,
      "end": 72.08
    },
    {
      "text": "And putting it online",
      "start": 66,
      "end": 72.08
    },
    {
      "text": "The site got 2,200 hits within 2 hours.",
      "start": 72.08,
      "end": 75.2
    },
    {
      "text": "This idea is potentially worth millions of dollars.",
      "start": 77.52,
      "end": 79.84
    },
    {
      "text": "You stole our website.",
      "start": 80.56,
      "end": 81.72
    },
    {
      "text": "They're saying we stole the Facebook idea.",
      "start": 81.72,
      "end": 83.6
    },
    {
      "text": "What it says.",
      "start": 83.6,
      "end": 84.16
    },
    {
      "text": "So did we?",
      "start": 84.16,
      "end": 85.36
    },
    {
      "text": "A million dollars isn't cool.",
      "start": 85.36,
      "end": 87.2
    },
    {
      "text": "You know what's cool?",
      "start": 85.36,
      "end": 87.2
    },
    {
      "text": "A billion dollars.",
      "start": 87.2,
      "end": 88.16
    },
    {
      "text": "You're going to get left behind.",
      "start": 88.16,
      "end": 90.08
    },
    {
      "text": "It's moving faster.",
      "start": 88.16,
      "end": 90.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Would any of us ever imagined that we'd be left behind?",
      "start": 90.08,
      "end": 92.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's sue him in federal court.",
      "start": 92.32,
      "end": 94.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Wait to stand over your shoulder and watch you write as a jackass.",
      "start": 94.36,
      "end": 96.48
    },
    {
      "text": "If you guys were the inventors of Facebook, you'd have invented Facebook.",
      "start": 96.48,
      "end": 99.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Is there anything that you need to tell me?",
      "start": 99.64,
      "end": 101.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Your actions could have permanently destroyed everything I've been working on.",
      "start": 101.76,
      "end": 104.16
    },
    {
      "text": "We have been working on.",
      "start": 104.16,
      "end": 105.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you like being a joke?",
      "start": 105.08,
      "end": 106.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you want to go back to that?",
      "start": 105.08,
      "end": 106.96
    },
    {
      "text": "This is our time.",
      "start": 109.92,
      "end": 113.24
    },
    {
      "text": "You're being accused of intentionally breaching security, violating copyrights, violating individual privacy.",
      "start": 113.24,
      "end": 120.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Your best friend is suing you for $600 million.",
      "start": 120.64,
      "end": 124.32
    },
    {
      "text": "As for the charges, I believe I deserve some recognition from this board.",
      "start": 126.28,
      "end": 132.84
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry.",
      "start": 132.84,
      "end": 134.28
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't understand.",
      "start": 135.56,
      "end": 136.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Which part?",
      "start": 136.8,
      "end": 137.8
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't belong here.",
      "start": 137.8,
      "end": 141.38000000000002
    }
